{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/31237575ad1caf5905be671fdb607551.poster.avif?t=1760537161\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/31237575ad1caf5905be671fdb607551.webm?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/31237575ad1caf5905be671fdb607551.mp4?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for the ultimate automotive adventure with Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition, an innovative racing game that fuses extreme parkour mechanics with high-speed driving. Designed to challenge even the most daring drivers, this game pushes the boundaries of both physics and imagination, delivering an adrenaline-fueled experience unlike anything you've ever played.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/f3c53eaa6f6c008c3b7c189f182b161f.poster.avif?t=1760537161\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/f3c53eaa6f6c008c3b7c189f182b161f.webm?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/f3c53eaa6f6c008c3b7c189f182b161f.mp4?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Parkour Action: Navigate through meticulously crafted tracks featuring gravity-defying jumps, ramps, loops, and obstacles that will test your precision and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Vehicle Selection: Explore an expansive lineup of distinct vehicles, each with specialized performance attributes, handling dynamics, and customizable aesthetics to suit various play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Customization: Tailor your vehicles to your exact specifications with an extensive customization system, including paint schemes, decals, performance parts, and unique visual enhancements that ensure your car stands out on every track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Environments: Experience spectacular, visually captivating environments filled with intricate details and dynamic elements designed to heighten your gaming immersion and challenge your driving skills to the utmost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Physics Engine: Master the complexities of realistic vehicle physics, including traction, momentum, and collision dynamics, to perform awe-inspiring stunts and flawless maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/aecaad486eb48dbff814ab4ca23b1b6b.poster.avif?t=1760537161\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/aecaad486eb48dbff814ab4ca23b1b6b.webm?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/aecaad486eb48dbff814ab4ca23b1b6b.mp4?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Choose Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level of Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition presents a unique challenge designed to captivate and excite. The precision controls and sophisticated driving physics ensure that each completed track feels rewarding and unforgettable. Whether you're competing against other racers online or testing your limits in single-player mode, Car Parkour X offers relentless excitement and satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of high-speed thrills, daring maneuvers, and ultimate competition. Prove your skills, defy the impossible, and rise to the pinnacle of automotive parkour greatness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush. Defy gravity. Become legendary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643330?t=1760537161","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643330?t=1760537161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/5852026301d4645196d4cdaa62b5025a5d26b131/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760537161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/5852026301d4645196d4cdaa62b5025a5d26b131/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760537161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Big Update: Brand New Parkour Map!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear players,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole new experience is waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have completely redesigned the parkour map with more challenging obstacles, exciting sections, and a fresh gameplay style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Brand-new parkour design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Smoother gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Improvements for more driving fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re constantly improving the game based on your feedback. Don\u2019t forget to share your thoughts with us! \ud83d\ude4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun and enjoy the ride!\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/31237575ad1caf5905be671fdb607551.poster.avif?t=1760537161\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/31237575ad1caf5905be671fdb607551.webm?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/31237575ad1caf5905be671fdb607551.mp4?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for the ultimate automotive adventure with Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition, an innovative racing game that fuses extreme parkour mechanics with high-speed driving. Designed to challenge even the most daring drivers, this game pushes the boundaries of both physics and imagination, delivering an adrenaline-fueled experience unlike anything you've ever played.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/f3c53eaa6f6c008c3b7c189f182b161f.poster.avif?t=1760537161\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/f3c53eaa6f6c008c3b7c189f182b161f.webm?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/f3c53eaa6f6c008c3b7c189f182b161f.mp4?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Parkour Action: Navigate through meticulously crafted tracks featuring gravity-defying jumps, ramps, loops, and obstacles that will test your precision and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Vehicle Selection: Explore an expansive lineup of distinct vehicles, each with specialized performance attributes, handling dynamics, and customizable aesthetics to suit various play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Customization: Tailor your vehicles to your exact specifications with an extensive customization system, including paint schemes, decals, performance parts, and unique visual enhancements that ensure your car stands out on every track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Environments: Experience spectacular, visually captivating environments filled with intricate details and dynamic elements designed to heighten your gaming immersion and challenge your driving skills to the utmost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Physics Engine: Master the complexities of realistic vehicle physics, including traction, momentum, and collision dynamics, to perform awe-inspiring stunts and flawless maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/aecaad486eb48dbff814ab4ca23b1b6b.poster.avif?t=1760537161\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/aecaad486eb48dbff814ab4ca23b1b6b.webm?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/extras/aecaad486eb48dbff814ab4ca23b1b6b.mp4?t=1760537161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Choose Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level of Car Parkour X: Zozo Edition presents a unique challenge designed to captivate and excite. The precision controls and sophisticated driving physics ensure that each completed track feels rewarding and unforgettable. Whether you're competing against other racers online or testing your limits in single-player mode, Car Parkour X offers relentless excitement and satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of high-speed thrills, daring maneuvers, and ultimate competition. Prove your skills, defy the impossible, and rise to the pinnacle of automotive parkour greatness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush. Defy gravity. Become legendary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Oguz Abdullah Celik","Muhammed Kaan Cay"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643330/7e8d004c32ed28908a97263c66546284e894d84c/header.jpg?t=1760537161","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643330/28536287/b7f13edd4e409499b905c52a919d9e4fab42e67c/1760454145/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760455436","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643330/28536287/b7f13edd4e409499b905c52a919d9e4fab42e67c/1760454145/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760455436","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643330/28536287/b7f13edd4e409499b905c52a919d9e4fab42e67c/1760454145/hls_264_master.m3